{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港姐許芷熒（前名：許亦妮）2019年下嫁圈外男友Alexander後即淡出，更憑「超強戰鬥力」四年抱三，專注湊仔的她早前罕有露面與同屆佳麗朱晨麗及朱希敏等人飯局聚舊，雖然已為人母但身材極Fit，不過樣貌卻被網民直指再進化，膠面尖下巴顯現。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:23:56.534665+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.713270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.713270+00:00","content_hash":"575a5a41f4c372937fa29762cd4c921c4583ccdb234cec2285d7e042237e695a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}